=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# play users ---------------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Play mode, mocks: the User Management screen proposed for$
# slice 5, drawn from the real control on a simulated host$
# (users.Read), each refusal the control's and each change$
# users.Admin's plan on the real plan/apply engine. Nothing on$
# this machine changes: every command and file is the fake's.$
$
# User Management hosts ########################################$
$
  Select a host$
$
   1) Debian 13 cloud      cloud-init's rule, a second user$
   2) Ubuntu 26.04         sudo-rs, %admin too$
   3) Alpine 3.23          doas through wheel$
   4) origin/main's file   /etc/sudoers.d/george$
   5) hardn's grant        hardn-grant-george$
   6) Second admin         alice, a password$
   7) One key, no keys     george's last key$
   8) Password asked       george has one$
   9) Alpine, no rule      george not in wheel$
  10) Alpine, locked       alice's account is "!"$
  11) hardn.yml's user     deploy isn't on the host$
  12) Rules not read       visudo -c rejects them$
  13) Root login           no SUDO_USER$
  14) Debian, no PAM       UsePAM no$
  15) Alpine, stray key    authorized_keys2 unread$
  16) Group-writable home  alice's home 0775$
  17) Proxmox VE 9         root alone, no sudo$
  18) No sudo              Debian without sudo$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter your choice [0-18 or q]: 3$
$
# Info: users/alpine323$
# web-01.example.net runs Alpine 3.23. As the VM: doas with$
# wheel.conf's permit nopass :wheel; george, uid 1001, and$
# alpine, uid 1000, in wheel, "*", /bin/ash; cloud-init's$
# sudoers file written where no sudo reads it; sshd without PAM.$
$
# User Management ##############################################$
$
  [+] User                 Configured non-root, doas$
$
# alpine -------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [ ] doas                 Enabled, No password to ask for$
   -  Granted by           group wheel$
  [ ] SSH Keys             None$
   -  Password             None$
$
# george -------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [ ] doas                 Enabled, No password to ask for$
   -  Granted by           group wheel$
   -  SSH Keys             2 keys$
   -  Password             None$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Manage User          Configure doas, SSH keys$
   2) Create User          Configure a new user$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter your choice [0-2 or q]: 0$
$
# User Management hosts ########################################$
$
  Select a host$
$
   1) Debian 13 cloud      cloud-init's rule, a second user$
   2) Ubuntu 26.04         sudo-rs, %admin too$
   3) Alpine 3.23          doas through wheel$
   4) origin/main's file   /etc/sudoers.d/george$
   5) hardn's grant        hardn-grant-george$
   6) Second admin         alice, a password$
   7) One key, no keys     george's last key$
   8) Password asked       george has one$
   9) Alpine, no rule      george not in wheel$
  10) Alpine, locked       alice's account is "!"$
  11) hardn.yml's user     deploy isn't on the host$
  12) Rules not read       visudo -c rejects them$
  13) Root login           no SUDO_USER$
  14) Debian, no PAM       UsePAM no$
  15) Alpine, stray key    authorized_keys2 unread$
  16) Group-writable home  alice's home 0775$
  17) Proxmox VE 9         root alone, no sudo$
  18) No sudo              Debian without sudo$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter your choice [0-18 or q]: 0$
$
# simulated system ---------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Nothing was applied.$
$

